# Regulus AI — line-ending policy.
# Go sources must stay LF so `gofmt -l` (gauntlet layer 12) is green on
# Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true (which would otherwise hand
# gofmt CRLF and fail TestGofmtClean).
*.go text eol=lf
*.mod text eol=lf
*.sum text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
